# playwright-cli scratch state
.playwright-cli/

# Orphans of the split-clients merge: crates/ and packages/ moved to
# github.com/crow-cli/crow, and git deleted every TRACKED file under them, but
# the build output they left on disk is not git's to remove — 58G of cargo
# target/ and 13G of packages/ (vendored-VSCodium sysroot caches, downloaded
# .vsix files, the packaged VSCode-* trees, node_modules, bun dists). Ignored
# so `git status` stays readable and a `git add -A` cannot swallow 71G.
# Deleting them is safe and reclaims the space; nothing here is a source of
# truth any more.
/target/
/packages/
